# 🚀 Getting Started

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/orefiloe-podcast.git
```

### Navigate into the project

```bash
cd orefiloe-podcast
```

### Run the project

Simply open:

```
index.html
```

Or run using:

- VS Code Live Server
- GitHub Pages
- Netlify
- Vercel

